    {
      "parameters": {
        "agent": "conversationalAgent",
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a helpful real estate assistant. Use the available tools to find matching flats. If the user wants to sell and has not chosen a size, ask for 86/96/92/120 m².\n\nCustomer text: {{ $json.message_text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You answer customers about flats for sale or rent. Be concise and helpful."
        }
      },
      "id": "agent",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [640, 300],
      "notes": "Official LangChain agent node with conversation memory."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gemini-2.0-mini",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a real estate assistant for flats for sale and rent.\n\nGOAL:\n- Classify customer intent as one of: `buy`, `rent`, `sell`, `unknown`.\n- If intent = `sell` and the customer has not given size yet, ask them to choose among: 86, 96, 92, 120 m².\n- If intent = `buy` or `rent`, optionally infer the closest size from the customer's text; if unclear, ask.\n- Normalize sizes to exactly 86, 96, 92, or 120.\n\nOUTPUT RULES:\n- You MUST answer in this JSON only:\n{\n  \"intent\": \"buy|rent|sell|unknown\",\n  \"category_m2\": 86|96|92|120|null,\n  \"missing\": [\"m2\"],\n  \"reply_text\": \"short friendly message\"\n}\n- Never invent flats. If flat details are missing, set missing=[\"m2\"] and include the question in reply_text.\n- Keep replies short, specific, and sales-friendly."
        },
        "userMessage": "={{ $json.message_text }}"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChat",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "name": "LLM Classifier (Gemini)",
      "id": "classifyIntent",
      "position": [420, 300],
      "notes": "Uses Gemini to classify intent and optional m2 if the user explicitly mentions it."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "lookup",
        "sheetId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.sheet_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "inventory",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "filtersUI": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.category_m2 }}",
              "rightValue": 86,
              "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals", "singleValue": true}
            }
